">a </span><span begin="00:26.440" end="00:27.160">reason</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.160" end="00:28.780"><span begin="00:27.160" end="00:27.310">It </span><span begin="00:27.310" end="00:27.580">killed </span><span begin="00:27.580" end="00:27.670">you </span><span begin="00:27.670" end="00:27.970">like </span><span begin="00:27.970" end="00:28.780">diseases</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.930" end="00:31.570"><span begin="00:28.930" end="00:29.140">And </span><span begin="00:29.140" end="00:29.170">I </span><span begin="00:29.170" end="00:29.350">can </span><span begin="00:29.350" end="00:29.680">hear </span><span begin="00:29.680" end="00:29.830">it </span><span begin="00:29.830" end="00:30.040">in </span><span begin="00:30.040" end="00:30.160">your </span><span begin="00:30.160" end="00:30.610">voice </span><span begin="00:30.610" end="00:30.850">while </span><span begin="00:30.850" end="00:30.940">your </span><span begin="00:30.940" end="00:31.450">speaking</span><span begin="00:31.450" end="00:31.490">.</span><span begin="00:31.490" end="00:31.530">.</span><span begin="00:31.530" end="00:31.570">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.570" end="00:32.830"><span begin="00:31.570" end="00:31.780">You </span><span begin="00:31.780" end="00:32.080">can't </span><span begin="00:32.080" end="00:32.170">be </span><span begin="00:32.170" end="00:32.830">treated</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.980" end="00:36.010"><span begin="00:32.980" end="00:33.430">Mr</span><span begin="00:33.430" end="00:33.430">. </span><span begin="00:33.430" end="00:33.760">know</span><span begin="00:33.760" end="00:33.790">-</span><span begin="00:33.790" end="00:33.850">it</span><span begin="00:33.850" end="00:33.880">-</span><span begin="00:33.880" end="00:34.390">all</span><span begin="00:34.390" end="00:34.390">, </span><span begin="00:34.390" end="00:34.660">had </span><span begin="00:34.660" end="00:34.810">his </span><span begin="00:34.810" end="00:35.